=== [[:Category:Champion Cards|Champions]] Update (27/10/2021) ===
'''King Level 14'''

* {{Balance|Add}} [[Cards]] and [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Towers]] can now be upgraded to [[Experience|Level 14]].
* {{Balance|Buff}} Experience requirements for certain King Levels have been reduced:
** The upgrade from King Level 13 to 14 costs the same amount of EXP as the old Level 12 to 13 upgrade.
** King Level 13 players gained further EXP based on their card upgrades and donations after reaching Level 13.
* {{Balance|Buff}} Card requirements for certain levels have been reduced.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Players who previously upgraded these card rarities at these levels were compensated with the card difference between the old and new values. For example, a Level 12 {{Rarity|Common}} Card before the update received 500 more copies after the update (2000 - 1500).
* {{Balance|Buff}} [[Gold]] requirements for certain levels have been reduced.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Upgrading from Level 13 to 14 costs the same amount of Cards and Gold as the old Level 12 to 13 upgrade.

'''Champions'''

* {{Balance|Add}} {{Rarity|Champion}} is a new rarity, unlocked at King Level 14.
* There can be only 1 {{Rarity|Champion}} card in your [[Battle Decks|deck]] and in play.
* There are 3 {{Rarity|Champion}} cards. Those are: [[Skeleton King]], [[Archer Queen]] & [[Golden Knight]].
* For a more detailed analysis, see the page for {{Rarity|Champion}} cards in general.

'''[[Star Points]]'''

* {{Balance|Neutral}} Star Points can now be spent starting from King Level 6.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Star Points now accumulate from King Level 1. As a result, Star Points have been separated from EXP, though they are still gained at the same rate in the same manner.
* {{Balance|Add}} Star Levels now unlock based on a card's level:
** Star Level 1 unlocks for Cards at Level 7.
** Star Level 2 unlocks for Cards at Level 10.
** Star Level 3 unlocks for Cards at Level 13.
* {{Balance|Buff}} The cost to upgrade a Star Level has been decreased.
* {{Balance|Add}} During a card's preview you may click on the top left to show the card at Star Levels 1, 2 and 3.

'''King's Journey'''

* {{Balance|Add}} King's Journey is a progression road based on Experience (like [[Trophies|Trophy Road]]), but for your King Level.
* Each time you unlock a new King Level, you will get a Level-Up [[Chests|Chest]]. This can only be obtained here.
* {{Balance|Add}} At King Level 14, the Level-Up Chest will have a guaranteed {{Rarity|Champion}} card.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} When the update went live, Level-Up Chests prior to a player's King Level were able to receive those Level-Up Chests.

'''[[Tournament|Tournaments]]'''

* {{Balance|Neutral}} The level cap is increased to Level 11 due to the addition of {{Rarity|Champion}} cards.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} All players joining Classic & Grand Challenges, [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Special Challenges]] & Global Tournaments will have every card at Level 11 (even if they don't have the card, or don‘t have the card at Level 11), and will be able to build their own deck from scratch, even with {{Rarity|Champion}} cards.

'''Miscellaneous'''

* {{Balance|Add}} There is a new Chest cycle containing Gold Crates, at King Level 10.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} {{Rarity|Legendary}} Cards appear more often. {{Rarity|Champion}} Card drop rate will be similar to how {{Rarity|Legendary}} Cards used to drop before the update.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Players can now rearrange their decks by holding and dragging cards.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Increased cooldown time between [[Emotes]] used in [[Basics of Battle|battle]].
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Increased required Trophies in [[Clans]] to reflect changes to Trophy Road.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Fixed [[TV Royale]] showing the incorrect [[Arenas|Arena]] number.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Fixed unintended interaction with [[Goblin Drill]] and [[Clone]].
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Changed the trail for Goblin Drill to make it more distinctive from [[Miner]].
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Fixed an issue with Replays becoming stuck.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Miscellaneous UI fixes.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Miscellaneous crash fixes.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Miscellaneous minor improvements.

