=== Summer 2021 Update (7/6/2021) ===
'''[[Clan Wars]] 2 Changes'''

* {{Balance|Neutral}} Fame has been renamed to Medals.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Boats now move on the river at the end of each day, as opposed to moving immediately upon gaining Medals. Players will move a certain distance based on how many Medals they have in relation to the other clans (1st - 5th).
* {{Balance|Add}} The first 3 days of each Clan War are now "Training Days", where only [[Gold]] can be gained from War Tasks, and opposing Clan Boats cannot be attacked. The remaining days are "Battle Days", where Gold and Medals can be gained from War Tasks, and Clan Boats will be vulnerable to attack.

'''Chest Changes'''

* {{Balance|Add}} A new type of [[Chests|Chest]] which can be gained from winning ladder or [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Party]] [[:Category:Modes|mode]] matches has been introduced, which will only reward Gold. There are 3 types of Gold Crates, which award different amounts of Gold and have different unlocking times:
** Gold Crate (3 hours to unlock).
** Plentiful Gold Crate (8 hours to unlock).
** Overflowing Gold Crate (12 hours to unlock).
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Gold Crates will replace Silver and Gold Chests in the [[Chests#Chest Cycle|Chest Cycle]].
* {{Balance|Add}} [[Experience|King Level]] 11, 12, and 13 will now have different Chest cycles, as opposed to King Levels 1-10.

'''[[Trophies|Trophy Road]] Changes'''

* {{Balance|Add}} [[Trophies#Leagues|Leagues]] now begin at 5,000 Trophies. Between 4,000 and 5,000 Trophies, two new [[Arenas]] have been added:
** Rascal's Hideout (Season 10 Arena - 4,200 Trophies).
** Serenity Peak (Season 7 Arena - 4,600 trophies).
* {{Balance|Buff}} Victory Gold now scales to Arena 14 (Serenity Peak).
* {{Balance|Buff}} Chest contents now scale to Arena 15 (Legendary Arena).
* {{Balance|Nerf}}The amount of Trophies lost when losing a Battle in the Challenger Leagues has been greatly increased.
* {{Balance|Buff}} In higher Leagues, the percentage of Trophies lost from the seasonal reset has been reduced:
** In the Challenger Leagues, Trophy counts will be reset by 50%, the previous amount for all players in Leagues.
** In the Master Leagues, Trophy counts will be reset by 40%.
** In the Champion Leagues, Trophy counts will be reset by 30%.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} The Legendary League, and Trophy Road, now extend to 8,000 Trophies.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Trophy Road rewards above 3,300 trophies have been renewed and become available to collect again.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} [[Cards|Card]] unlocks have been shuffled around to accommodate for the new Arenas.

'''Other Changes'''

*{{Balance|Add}} Players who are at King Level 8 or higher can access 10 [[Battle Decks|Deck]] slots.
* {{Balance|Add}} Replays can now be fast forwarded and rewinded.
* {{Balance|Add}}Players can now choose to randomize their [[King's Tower|Tower Skin]] upon entering a [[Basics of Battle|Battle]].
* {{Balance|Buff}}Trophy Road rewards above 5,000 Trophies now contain more [[Magic Items#Wild Card|Wild Cards]] and be more frequent overall.
* {{Balance|Add}} [[Friendly Battle|Friendly Battles]] now have 15 game modes that will always be available.

'''Bug Fixes'''

* {{Balance|Neutral}} A bug which allowed more than 50 members to participate in a Clan War was fixed.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} A bug related to the Magic Coin and [[Trade Tokens|trades]] was fixed. An exploit which allowed players to receive Card overflow Gold upon cancelling a trade was removed.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} A bug where a card's deployment would lag if it was played as soon as it was dealt to the player's hand was fixed.
* {{Balance|Add}} Players are now able spectate [[Supercell ID]] friends.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Fixed some issues related to [[Fisherman]].
* {{Balance|Nerf}}[[Bandit]]’s dash no longer continues after the timer reaches zero.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} The strike icon from [[Pass Royale]] was removed.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Fixed missing [[Mirror]] deployment animation.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Minor improvements were made to the localization and UI.

