=== 2021 Quarter 1 Update (30/3/2021) ===
'''[[Magic Items]]'''

* {{Balance|Neutral}} A new category of items has been introduced, allowing players to upgrade [[cards]] more quickly as well as have more choice over which cards they receive. They are as follows:
* {{Balance|Add}} Wild Card - comes in the four card rarities. These can be converted into any card of its rarity that the player owns. When opening a [[Chests|Chest]] above [[Arenas|Arena]] 4, there is a chance that the player will receive a Wild Card in lieu of a regular card.
* {{Balance|Add}} Book of Cards - instantly gives the player the amount of cards needed to upgrade a card to its next Level. Like Wild Cards, these come in four rarities. There is also a "Book of Books", which can be used for any card rarity.
* {{Balance|Add}} Magic Coin - allows the player to upgrade a card to its next level without spending any of their current [[Gold]].
* {{Balance|Add}} Chest Key - allows the player to immediately open a chest won via the ladder, as opposed to having to spend [[Gems]].
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Magic Items are available via Chests, [[Trophies|Trophy Road]], paid offers in the [[Shop]], [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Special Challenges]], and [[Pass Royale]] (note that not all Magic Items are available through all methods).
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Wild Card information has been added to the Shop chest, Chest slot, Chest content, and Shop confirm pop-ups.

'''[[Clan Wars]] 2 and UI changes'''

* {{Balance|Add}} Leaders and Co-leaders can now 'nudge' players to remind them to do their [[Basics of Battle|battles]]!
* {{Balance|Add}} "Decks Remaining Today" is now visible on the UI.
* {{Balance|Add}} War [[Battle Decks|deck]] cooldowns are synchronized with each individual [[Clans|Clan]]’s war week start. There is no longer a delay where some Clans can use an ‘extra set’ of War Deck attacks before the War Decks reset for everyone.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} Fame rewards have been simplified - Card Levels will no longer impact the amount of Fame gained from performing River Tasks.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} The Battle Deck UI has been updated.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} The context menu for Battle Decks has been updated - The "Magic" button will be available, which was previously only available in War Decks.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} [[Emotes]] and [[King's Tower|Tower Skins]] now have separate sections, with Magic Items receiving their own section.

